<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78682" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρᾰριθμ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>reckon in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς αἶγάς τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					6.596.5
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.613
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PStrassb.</u>
				116.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>count over, check</i> items in an inventory, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMich.Zen.</u>
				31.12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).163
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Bg</u>
				19
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				874
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				5
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>), v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>To.</u>
				9.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>pay over</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς λόγους -ούμενοι
				καὶ -οῦντες</span>
			<i>receiving</i> and <i>giving in payment</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.78f
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>deceive in counting</i> : generally, <i>cheat</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				3.147
			</span></i> (
				Act.
			 and 
				Pass.
			).</div>
